        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/calm/ecosystem>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/calm/ldap>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/calm/network>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/calm/service>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/calm/system>,
        <https://w3id.org/lmodel/calm/webclient> .

