    linkml:definition_uri "https://w3id.org/lmodel/calm/RelationshipType"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    linkml:description "Tagged-union container for the variant body of a relationship. Exactly one of ``interacts``, ``connects``, ``deployed_in``, ``composed_of``, ``options`` is populated; see ``RelationshipKind`` for the discriminator values." ;
